      "summaries": {
        "en": "Goose is an open-source AI agent framework that extends beyond basic code suggestions to handle full software development workflows. Its technical innovation lies in using the Model Context Protocol (MCP) to create modular, extensible agents that can install dependencies, execute code, edit files, and run tests autonomously. Developers can integrate Goose with any LLM through its Rust-based architecture to build custom agents for tasks like automated testing, code refactoring, or continuous integration pipelines, making AI-assisted development more practical and scalable.",
        "zh": "Goose是一个开源AI智能体框架，它超越了传统的代码建议功能，能够处理完整的软件开发工作流程。其核心技术在于采用模型上下文协议（MCP）构建模块化、可扩展的智能体，这些智能体可以自主安装依赖、执行代码、编辑文件和运行测试。基于Rust的架构允许开发者连接任何大语言模型，创建定制化智能体用于自动化测试、代码重构或持续集成等场景，为AI辅助开发提供了更实用、可扩展的解决方案。",
        "es": "Goose is an open-source AI agent framework that extends beyond basic code suggestions to handle full software development workflows. Its technical innovation lies in using the Model Context Protocol (MCP) to create modular, extensible agents that can install dependencies, execute code, edit files, and run tests autonomously. Developers can integrate Goose with any LLM through its Rust-based architecture to build custom agents for tasks like automated testing, code refactoring, or continuous integration pipelines, making AI-assisted development more practical and scalable.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "goose stands out for acp, ai, and ai-agents in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Goose is an open-source AI agent framework that extends beyond basic code suggestions to handle full software development workflows. Its technical innovation lies in using the Model Context Protocol (MCP) to create modular, extensible agents that can install dependencies, execute code, edit files, and run tests autonomously. Developers can integrate Goose with any LLM through its Rust-based architecture to build custom agents for tasks like automated testing, code refactoring, or continuous integration pipelines, making AI-assisted development more practical and scalable.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
