      "summaries": {
        "en": "QMD is a local CLI search engine that enables fast, private document retrieval without cloud dependencies. It implements state-of-the-art embedding and indexing techniques to efficiently search personal knowledge bases, meeting notes, and documentation offline. Users can integrate it into their workflow by indexing markdown files or connecting it to note-taking apps for instant, secure information access across their digital workspace.",
        "zh": "QMD是一款本地命令行搜索工具，专为个人文档、知识库和会议笔记提供快速、私密的检索服务。它采用前沿的嵌入和索引技术，在离线环境下高效处理文本数据，避免了云服务的依赖和隐私风险。用户可通过索引Markdown文件或连接笔记应用，将其集成到日常工作流中，实现安全、即时的信息查找，特别适合开发者、研究人员和知识工作者管理分散的文档资源。",
        "es": "QMD is a local CLI search engine that enables fast, private document retrieval without cloud dependencies. It implements state-of-the-art embedding and indexing techniques to efficiently search personal knowledge bases, meeting notes, and documentation offline. Users can integrate it into their workflow by indexing markdown files or connecting it to note-taking apps for instant, secure information access across their digital workspace.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "qmd gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "QMD is a local CLI search engine that enables fast, private document retrieval without cloud dependencies. It implements state-of-the-art embedding and indexing techniques to efficiently search personal knowledge bases, meeting notes, and documentation offline. Users can integrate it into their workflow by indexing markdown files or connecting it to note-taking apps for instant, secure information access across their digital workspace.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/tobi/qmd for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
