        "zh": "Telegram-iOS 是 Telegram 官方开源的 iOS 客户端，专注于提供安全、功能丰富的即时通讯体验。它采用 Swift 语言开发，通过现代化的并发模型和优化的网络层实现高效实时通信，支持大规模群组和媒体传输而不影响性能。开发者可以借鉴其架构设计构建可扩展的聊天应用，利用 SwiftUI 组件自定义界面，或学习其加密协议增强自身项目的隐私保护能力，适合用于研究高性能移动通讯应用的实现方案。",
        "es": "Telegram-iOS is the official open-source iOS client for Telegram, providing a secure and feature-rich messaging experience. It showcases efficient real-time communication through Swift's modern concurrency model and optimized network layers, ensuring smooth performance even with large groups and media. Developers can study its architecture for building scalable chat apps, customize the UI with SwiftUI components, or integrate its encryption protocols into their own projects for enhanced privacy.",
